Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.99,0:00:01.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Astounding!{驚天動地}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:02.83,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Unprecedented!{前代未聞}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.83,0:00:04.00,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Preposterous!{言語道断}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.05,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Earth shattering!{ shaking!}{天地鳴動}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:05.96,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Unparalleled!{空前絶後}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.02,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Indomitable!{臥薪嘗胆}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:07.92,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Distress!{四苦八苦}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:08.90,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Agony!{七転八倒}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:09.90,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Precarious future!{前途多難}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:10.84,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Ostensible{alt Nominal}!{有名無実}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:11.86,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Impregnable!{難攻不落}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:12.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Fatigue!{疲労困憊}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:13.99,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Dire straits!{絶体絶命}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:15.19,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Despair!{青息吐息}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:15.94,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Public nuisance!{近所迷惑}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:17.09,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Technicolour!{総天然色}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:18.04,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Hard struggle!{悪戦苦闘}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.61,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Coming soon!{近日公開}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:22.04,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, that's enough of your idioms already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.30,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Does this not bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:27.51,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Not only has SoLaMi SMILE already reformed,{not only have they let them reform ahead of them}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:31.07,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,they've also taken the Dream Theatre\N Unveiling Concert from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.97,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Of course it's buggin' me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:36.49,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I want the three of us to sing together again.{I also want the three of us to sing together soon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.07,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],It's all 'cause Sion screwed everything up.{That's because Sion screwed up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.11,0:00:43.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If you'd just listened to me, we would have won.{If you would have just listened to(cooperate with) me, we would have won.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:44.98,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:47.26,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's because you jumped ahead on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:48.64,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:51.12,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's because you were dragging us down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:55.25,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,R-Relax, you two, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:01:00.39,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Why don't we think of{do} something\Nthat will help us reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:02.35,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{lit: You're right.}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:06.10,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,However, there's not much we can do without Usagi.{with usagi having ran away}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:10.35,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,For the time being, why don't we go look for two more members?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:11.83,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:15.53,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'll use my charm and scout us\Na crazy awesome team member!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:19.53,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I'll do my best as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.26,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The fourth prophecy goes into effect now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:23.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Ye best prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.17,0:01:27.29,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:29.71,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Here's a special spaghetti alle vongole bun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:34.50,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's scrumptious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Ye best prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:10.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Go! Farewell-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:13.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:15.39,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:16.74,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:21.11,Default-Alt,SoLaMi,0,0,0, [..],1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:21.43,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Brilliant. That's brilliant-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:23.27,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You're the best-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:24.90,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You're shining-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:29.11,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now that you've reformed, you're shining brighter\N and are more cheerful than ever-kuma!{With your reformation you shine and are more\Nhigh spirited than ever-kuma.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:31.70,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's tiring, yet still fun!{I'm having fun even though it's tiring.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:34.44,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],SoLaMi SMILE has made a complete pri-covery!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:36.65,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's do another concert today-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:38.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.88,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Let's!{as in let's do it}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:41.13,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:44.87,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And while we're at it, let's jump up\N the ranks and become Divine Idols!{ let's charge on to being Divine Idols all in one go!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.48,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's true-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:50.42,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,The curse had no effect on Kuma-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:52.58,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Was the curse fake-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.64,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:55.14,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Neko...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:57.99,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,[honorific][term fix],Was Neko lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.65,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,There's no way-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:03.35,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But, seeing Kuma like that...{in that state}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.61,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm so confused-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:09.47,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You've always been my Go rival up until now, Iroha.{orig: ,}{Although you've been my Go rival up until now, Iroha,}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.32,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Therefore I think you'd be an exceptionally strong ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:15.28,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Form a Dream Team with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:18.25,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,I humbly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:21.34,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:22.76,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:27.17,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,I am your rival through and through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:30.76,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,I will{can} not team up with you until I defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:32.38,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Until we meet again.{Now then / later / good bye}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:34.82,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:36.46,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You truly are my rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.61,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I await our next battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:41.44,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,But of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:43.40,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'll be the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:47.95,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This isn't a laughing matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:50.34,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I should continue looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.20,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:54.73,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Mikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:56.37,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelrun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:59.93,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],You're always super cool, Sion{-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:02.71,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix],I really want you to join Aromageddon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:05.54,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You want me on your team?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.06,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:11.68,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm trying to reform Dressing Pafé.{My objective is the reformation of Dressing Pafé}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:15.51,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Dorothy{-chan}'s gonna join us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.39,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:17.85,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Dorothy is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:20.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix],That's what Aroma said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.67,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Please think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:26.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,May the heavens bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:27.69,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:32.16,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Has Dorothy really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:35.79,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The two of you are also Major ranked, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:38.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It'd be great if you two joined our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:43.01,Default,Mew,0,0,0,,We're roses that can no longer be sold separately-mew.{It seems we can no longer be sold separately-mew. -note: There's a rose pun in here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:45.46,Default,New,0,0,0,,Our bond is stronger than that of twins-new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.34,Default,New,0,0,0,,If you'd like to be partners, there are two openings below us-new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:49.77,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:53.55,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,As if I want to be part of such a lame getup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:55.08,Default,Mew,0,0,0,,Lame-mew?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.26,Default,New,0,0,0,,It's part of our soul-new! {lit- (a member of) the community of (our) soul}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:03.73,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And here I thought I'd offer my help to those who just happened to be good enough to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:06.66,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Major-rank idols after ten years of PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:07.84,Default,New,0,0,0,,How rude-new!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.99,Default,Mew,0,0,0,,We're done here-mew.{alt: we're leaving}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:15.89,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And here I was politely inviting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:19.87,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this, I guess it's time to let loose the killer max beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.83,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],Dorothy West.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:25.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,As I thought, you are a hellion.{inhabitant of hell}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.31,0:06:27.75,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's the demon idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:31.84,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Join our team and baptise Pripara in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.11,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:34.60,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What nonsense are you spouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:35.59,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:37.22,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If you want to partner with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.60,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],then why don't you join Dressing Pafé?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:43.15,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],Only Dorothy and Sion are disciples of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:47.31,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],I have no use for the timid, plain, and always smiling Reona.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:51.02,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Don't you dare talk bad about Reona, you fake demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:54.64,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,As if there's anyone who would join your team!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.24,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.23,0:06:58.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}She really pisses me off! {or something less vulgar}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:02.64,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, this makes me want this imp even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.72,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What a splendidly foul mouth you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:06.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You truly are my kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.85,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],Sion has already become my servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:10.86,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:13.17,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Sion already joined your team?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.55,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You'd do well to think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:19.31,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.48,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devidevi Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:27.43,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],How dare you, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:31.15,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,[term fix],Hooray! I got Reona's autograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:34.61,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,[term fix],I can't wait to see Dressing Pafé on stage again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:37.70,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:38.92,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,,All right then, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.33,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.33,0:07:43.79,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We're looking for new teammates...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:43.21,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,You got her autograph, isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.88,Default-Alt,Fan1,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm really happy!{almost put stoked...xD}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:47.35,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,It's kind of hard to find people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:52.97,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Reona, have you seen Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:53.95,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.00,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.03,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:07:59.31,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,But what's with that getup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:01.10,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Is there something you need?{I SOOOO want to put "Were you looking for me?" >_>}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:03.64,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:05.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I heard about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:07.85,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's this about joining that demon and angel's team?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:08.69,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:10.40,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.91,0:08:13.32,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You're one to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:17.56,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,So you've joined their team, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:18.15,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{bg}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:19.73,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Just who are you calling a traitor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:21.39,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?!{what do you mean?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:22.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:23.95,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,No, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:27.12,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Calm down, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:30.84,Default,Doro,0,0,0,,You're always acting so high and mighty.{proud of yoruself.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:33.41,Default,Doro,0,0,0,,You're stubborn and never listen to other people's opinions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:36.33,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,How about you do something about that sharp tongue of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:39.33,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Each and every word of yours is like a thorn!{lit: is a thorn!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:41.54,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Go idols are out of fashion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.43,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,As is your use of the word "Go"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:47.27,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,As always, you have no appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:48.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:49.85,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This is your end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:54.98,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You monochrome samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:56.57,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Shut it, you foul-mouthed mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:58.53,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:04.07,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm lost-usa. Hopelessly lost-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:07.62,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Didn't she use these to tell our fortune?{Aren't these from when she read our fortune?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:12.04,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's true! The curse really is true-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:15.00,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:16.45,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.21,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:18.72,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.76,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,She just taped a picture to the back of it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.52,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Was it really a farce-usa?{Could this have been a farce-usa?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.80,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's true-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:29.69,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[honorific][term fix],We've been had by Neko-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.65,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:37.07,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive her for toying\N with my pure manly heart-usa! {alt- pure man's heart, man's pure heart}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.83,0:09:39.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Exactly-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:42.57,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now then, let's thoroughly interrogate her,{Now as to why she lied,}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:45.53,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,and find out why she lied to us-kuma!{Let's thoroughly interrogate her-kuma!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.53,0:09:47.38,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Hey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:50.46,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,How dare you trick us-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:50.46,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\3c&H0B0C5B&}How dare you trick us-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:53.18,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this, you fiend-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:55.50,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:57.76,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[honorific][term fix],Neko, what's wrong-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.13,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Did something happen-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:00.70,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Tell us everything-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.34,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,We're here for you-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:05.39,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm sorry-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.39,0:10:08.89,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I lied to both of you-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:10.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[honorific][term fix],Neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.35,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But... why?{But, why did you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:16.32,Default,Nekon,0,0,0,,I enjoy teasing the person I like-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:19.59,Default,Nekon,0,0,0,,I hope you can understand...{Can you understand...}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:22.03,Default,Nekon,0,0,0,,a woman's wavering heart-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:26.44,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,When you say "person you like",\Ndo you mean me-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:28.58,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,No, she obviously means me, right-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:29.96,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,No, me-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.00,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Me-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:33.38,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:40.49,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Anyway, now I know there is no curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:42.93,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,With this, we can happily reform-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:47.15,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Let's start the ritual-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:47.85,Default,Shithy,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:48.59,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.92,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Dressing Pafé is dead{lit is disbanded}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:52.83,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],I refuse to team up with Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:56.05,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Teaming up with Sion would be\Nlike{wanting to} teaming up with a pancake.{monjyayaki.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:57.52,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.61,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,W-What happened-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:03.74,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,It might be impossible for us to get back together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.98,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:07.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:09.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Sion{-san} and Dorothy{-san} did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:12.41,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,They said they won't reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:17.08,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,[term fix],Even Reona, the one who normally stops them{gets inbetween them},\Ndoesn't know what to do this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:20.97,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I don't have anyone to rely on \Nother than the three of you-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:24.37,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Usagi{-san}'s ears are drooping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:26.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:28.85,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go find out what's going on.{ talk to them.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:33.07,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Dorothy{-san} betrayed the team?{has betrayed the team?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:35.10,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I never thought she would.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:37.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Surely this is a misunderstanding?{Don't you think you might be misunderstanding something?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:39.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.67,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I've been tolerating it up until now,{Until now I've been tolerating her,}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:44.07,Default,Shion,0,0,0, [hard to read?],but she always has to get the last word, and I'm tired of it!{she's always saying one word too many and getting on my nerves!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:47.03,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This was the final straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:48.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.02,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You're unwelcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:51.60,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This conversation is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:55.27,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Why the heck would I apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:56.71,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This isn't some joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:59.48,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Sion's the one who messed it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:02.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],There's no way Sion{-san} would betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:04.17,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],I'm sure you know that, Dorothy{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:07.69,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Sion's always irritated me to the max.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Always looking down on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:11.69,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}So do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:16.10,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I thought this was just another one of their arguments,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:19.15,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,but they won't listen to anything I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:21.12,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,If you don't find a way to get through to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:24.20,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Dressing Pafé really will crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:28.01,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Even if you say that, if I fail...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:31.16,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can get them to reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:34.40,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Are you okay with that, Reona{-chan}?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.19,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[term fix],This is a bit much...{he's saying basically the same thing as Mirei but with a sound effect}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:51.52,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What a sour atmosphere-pri.{heavy - as in bad}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:54.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Come on girls, don't turn your backs to each other!{turn the other way}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:55.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's talk this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:13:01.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hey, look at me! I'm a snail!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.79,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{gorilla sounds}I'm a gorilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:07.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit! I'm a frog-ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:14.74,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That's enough. Quit being so stubborn-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:17.03,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Do you really want to stay disbanded forever-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:18.75,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,There's no way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:20.46,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's no getting over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:22.71,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Poor Reona{-chan}...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:29.34,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],It wasn't my intention to be mean to Reona...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:32.55,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm sure Reona understands my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:34.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This has to be a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm going to call Reona.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.93,0:13:37.89,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:40.81,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,1,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:42.27,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,2,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:44.23,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,3,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:45.56,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,4...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:46.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Reona, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:55.80,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,O-Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:58.47,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Did you sprain your ankle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:00.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You shouldn't push yourself that hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:02.74,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If I put even more effort into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.34,Default,Leona,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm sure Sion and Dorothy will...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:08.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Reona?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, what is it-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:14.80,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Reona is going to do a solo concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:20.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,She's going to do it even though she sprained her ankle.{She sprained her ankle, but she told me she's still doing it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:23.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Please come over here, and quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:27.87,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Would you like to enter without a manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:28.73,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:31.69,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Will you be okay with that sprained ankle?{but it seems you've sprained your ankle, is it okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:33.91,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,U-Uh... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:35.70,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Reona!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.33,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:40.16,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,What's the meaning behind this solo concert-usa?!{What do you mean you're doing a solo concert-usa?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.96,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:46.17,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,to put on a concert for our fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:49.42,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,But you're injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:50.64,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:52.13,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I-I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.84,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,After all, it's my concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:58.00,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's impossible with an injury like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:59.56,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You should rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:02.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I said I'm doing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.07,0:15:02.94,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,So I'm doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:03.89,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:05.35,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I'm doing it!{!!!!!!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:07.60,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Why are you so stubborn all of sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.44,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Listen to others' opinions once in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:12.85,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're always acting so high and mighty!{consistancy with earlier}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:15.23,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're stubborn and never listen to other people's opinions!{consistency with earlier}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:19.28,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Don't do it, Reona.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:21.50,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Go rest, I'll {go }do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:22.96,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:27.25,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,All you do is fight, so I can't\Nleave it to someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.59,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Why would you say something so mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:33.30,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}How about you do something about that sharp tongue of yours?{consistency with earlier}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.54,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Each and every word of yours is like a thorn!{consistency with earlier}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.48,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:51.61,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'd like to help, so do you mind\N if we do the concert together?{Since I want to help your concert,\Ncan we do it together?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:55.95,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I also want to help...{lit: go out on stage, but that sounds kind of oddly selfish in English for what I believe they're going for}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.41,Default,Shithy,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.41,Default,Shithy,0,0,0,,{\3c&H430A92&}We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.79,Default,Shithy,0,0,0,,Please let us be a three-person team again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.79,Default,Shithy,0,0,0,,{\3c&H430A92&}Please let us be a three-person team again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:13.51,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:16.07,Default,Shithy,0,0,0,,Don't overdo it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:20.73,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I was so happy, I forgot I sprained my ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.35,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:25.14,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Use this to numb it instantly-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:26.46,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,With this secret remedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:29.06,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able to handle one concert-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:30.10,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.52,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Usagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:33.70,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:37.97,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to perform without both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:42.74,Default,Leona,0,0,0,[term fix],After all, I don't have Sion's stubbornness or confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:47.50,Default,Leona,0,0,0,[term fix],or Dorothy's unyielding spirit{spirit that won't give into anyone}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:51.66,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,But, if the three of us are together,\Nwe can go anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:56.59,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Let's turn over a new leaf with Dressing Pafé's reformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:57.84,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:02.01,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Now that it's been decided,\Nlet's get on with the ritual-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:05.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Though, I don't think there's any\Nhelping Sion's stubbornness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.39,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They've finally made up-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:15.11,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Promise: Believe in friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:17.11,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.80,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Paradise: Our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:22.82,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,We swear to stand on stage as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:28.30,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number\Nof My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:32.21,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:34.57,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:39.03,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,To commemorate your reformation,{To decorate the start of your reformation,}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:42.83,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,a tight-fitting rock style jacket has been mixed in to form a new coord.{a new coord with a tight-fitting rock stye(taste) jacket (mixed in).}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:44.76,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Rock Style Lady Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:46.39,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:53.00,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The abundant shiny fabric glitters brightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.15,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Rock Style Lady Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:56.90,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:03.24,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix],It's been boldly designed with a fashionable pattern sporting Dressing Pafé's logo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:05.74,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Rock Style Lady Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:14.81,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,[term fix],Dressing Pafé!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:15.96,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:17.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:18.62,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Do your best-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:19.80,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.76,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We're singing together again!{lit-The three of us CAN sing together again!}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:25.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This is how it should be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:28.59,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's be a team forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.98,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\an1}Even if I can't do it alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.59,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\an1}{\fad(0,100)}As long as we're together...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.59,0:19:00.13,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\an1}{\fad(100,100)}As long as we're together...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:02.15,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\an1}{\fad(100,0)}As long as we're together...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:04.03,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,{\an1}We can go anywhere!
