Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:19.87,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Purple is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:21.38,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],So I got the same as Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:24.13,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We got blue, so we're pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:25.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],The same as Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:29.36,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:33.47,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Now go find two more and assemble a Dream Team!{Now rush out and find two more to make a Dream Team!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:40.15,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,Those fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:44.61,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That was cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:47.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Dressing Pafé has finally reformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:50.11,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll need to work hard, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.11,0:20:51.03,Default,Sorelle,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:55.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Though, Aroma{-chan} and Mikan{-chan} are really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:58.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're normally like?{outside of PriPara}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:21:01.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Your prophecy didn't go as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:06.18,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix],Both SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé have reformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:08.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Time to put the fifth prophecy into effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Chapter 6, section 606:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:16.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"Starting today, we shall show ourselves to the \Nhuman world for the sake of the final judgment."{editing help}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:17.48,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:18.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:24.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Aroma{-chan} and Mikan{-chan}?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:29.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,With that outfit... Does that mean—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:30.32,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:33.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're students at Paprika Primary Academy?!{Paprika Academy's primary school branch}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:33.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.53,0:23:09.98,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Aroma{-chan} and Mikan{-chan} are\Nstudents at Paprika Academy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:12.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,On on top of that, they're also 6th graders?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:15.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The prophesy has reached a new page.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.09,0:23:17.85,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,We shall henceforth rule this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:18.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:20.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,The angel and demon's broom is...{ブルーム- Maybe they're making one fly or something? I'm not really sure.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:22.64,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],SoLaMi SMILE, Dressing Pafé,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:24.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,will you join my kin or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:27.09,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,If you join our team, you'll be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:29.14,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,First come, first served...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:29.91,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.91,0:23:31.97,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The Devil in the Next Class.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.35,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:34.90,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
